    "id": "M26",
    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "取得／构造的组合操作进入沟通、分节、绑定与新使用；移动形成访问，取得的访问记录及当前歧义现能选择后续接触，重看改变下一选择。实际执行、正确性与确信分开，错误唯一绑定仍可使探究误停。完整认知、学习与演化心理目标继续。",
    "claim_en": "Acquired/formed composition enters communication, grouping, binding and new use. Movement forms access; acquired access records and current ambiguity now select subsequent encounters, and reobservation changes the next choice. Execution, correctness and confidence remain distinct: wrong unique bindings can still stop inquiry. The full cognitive/evolutionary objective continues.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定23／41；行动场景16／29；经历选择新增22／46，最新317项继承审计分列。空间／类别、目录、选择准则、初次巡查及合作命名仍给定。下一连接是维持覆盖的选择性注意与相互沟通协调的发育对应；完整心理、演化对应及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition: 25 theorems / 52 audits; formation: 37 / 65; transmission: 27 / 45; grouping: 23 / 51; binding: 23 / 41; enacted scenes: 16 / 29; encounter selection adds 22 / 46, with 317 inherited audits separately rebuilt. Spatial/category laws, catalogue, choice criterion, initial surveys and cooperative naming remain supplied. Next: developmental correspondence for selective attention and reciprocal coordination sustaining coverage; full psychology, evolutionary correspondence and consciousness remain incomplete.",
